# Time-boxed exceptions for the Dependency advisories job.
#
# Only add an entry when a CRITICAL advisory has no upgrade path yet, and always
# give it an expiry so it comes back instead of silently living forever:
#
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#
# HIGH advisories do not need entries here — they are tracked in an issue and
# fixed by the weekly Dependabot PRs rather than blocking the pipeline.
